{"ts":"2026-07-12T06:11:43.742Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T06:11:43.742Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:11:43.742Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"PR#520 (merged 2026-07-12) shipped AC halves 1-2: SDK primitives ensurePmGitignore/getPmGitignoreBlock (src/sdk/workspace.ts, re-exported via runtime) + pm init writes/repairs the fenced ignore block at the workspace root in discovered/explicit/tracker-path modes with updated:gitignore:<path> warning; docs/SDK.md + docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md updated. REMAINING scope (why this stays open): AC half 3 — pm validate or pm health warning when tracked .agents/pm runtime/search cache files already exist in git (git rm --cached remediation hint); grep confirms no validate/health implementation on main. Optional: init/getting-started docs coverage beyond AGENT_GUIDE."}]}],"before_hash":"72003bdaf3465663f747bb961c4b474263e555dc4406bb26192f4dbf9d99d66a","after_hash":"008f72eabea5258e1e1370b15b3f8f7b42270839fd9c5e00b78b07a58e2bf855"}
