{"ts":"2026-07-13T09:18:15.457Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-13T09:18:15.456Z","author":"maintainer-agent","text":"Scope extension (pass #77, 2026-07-13): the fenced ignore block MUST also cover .agents/pm/locks/ — concrete failure: review pass #76's commit (67ccbcf4) accidentally committed .agents/pm/locks/reindex.lock (a live-pid runtime lock) because this repo's .gitignore covered runtime/ and search/ but not locks/. The tracked-cache health warning (AC half 3) should likewise flag tracked lock files. Our own repo's .gitignore gets the locks/ line directly this pass (hygiene fix, pass #77 commit); pm init's fenced block owns it for user repos."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-13T09:18:15.457Z"}],"before_hash":"5256728e7bdbc66383f7f5b7e8b4b97a642f939b4d4f8b70bd4a181798c19158","after_hash":"b34a1d0f17eaac1338fecca5e2586d419343ccfbfce6df864a03222ebc0faee7"}
